:''For the other unit of the same name, see [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Cat Devil''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Capsule during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 476
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Cat Devil
|name2 = Infernal Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Infernal Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Infernal Cat has good stats against Angels, but his range is rather low, limiting his usage to angels such as [[Boraphim]] and [[Angelic Gory]]. [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Time Traveller Cat]] is, however, a much better choice against Angels due to higher range and better spammability, which results in better spammable DPS. You'd mainly want to use this unit in {{4c}} stages.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

